Audience objections and fears
title end

paragraph start
Objections are the reasons people give for not acting, such as no time, no equipment, doubt that it works or distrust of sellers. These are examples to look for, not findings.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Record each real objection with a count and the exact words. Common objections shape content, because each deserves a post that answers it.
paragraph end

